{
 "_comment": [
  "SHARED FIXTURE — byte-identical in Portal-septa and oliver-api-septa.",
  "",
  "The Portal runs these through src/builder/totals.ts + merge.ts; oliver-api",
  "runs the same cases through lib/documentModel.js. Each repo asserts the",
  "SAME expected numbers, so the two implementations cannot drift: change the",
  "arithmetic in one and the other goes red.",
  "",
  "The discipline is SEAM-6-A's, which blesses the three byte-identical copies",
  "of renderTemplate.js kept honest by test/fixtures/merge-tag-cases.json.",
  "",
  "Copy this file whole when you change it. Do not edit one copy."
