    "discount": 0
   },
   "merge": {},
   "expect": {
    "subtotal": 0,
    "tax": 0,
    "total": 0,
    "line_count": 2,
    "sites": []
   },
   "note": "D-165 (scope 11.13.3): the old pricing_table is DELETED and upgrade-on-open turns each of its rows into a price_line. A rate card's cell held WORDS ($185.00 / push), never a number, so every line arrives priced at ZERO — the SUBTOTAL is unchanged, which is the guarantee, and the line COUNT goes 0 to 2 because the rows are now things the author can price. oliver-api lib/documentModel.js runs this same file."
